    {
      "id": "200020A2",
      "title": "Space Suit",
      "subtitle": "Your Lifeline Off-World",
      "description": [
        "Most planets have no breathable atmosphere — without a Space Suit, you take continuous damage and die in seconds.",
        "Craft the full set: helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots",
        "Materials: steel plates, glass panes, rubber, leather",
        "The suit has an oxygen meter (blue bar, lower-left of screen)",
        "Full oxygen = approximately 10 minutes of survival off-world",
        "Suit durability damage and oxygen depletion are separate systems — monitor both",
        "Fill oxygen at an Oxygen Distributor before every launch."
      ],
      "icon": "stellaris:space_suit_helmet",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1,
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "dependencies": [
