    {
      "id": "200020AB",
      "title": "First Rocket",
      "subtitle": "Tier 1 — Destination Moon",
      "description": [
        "Assemble your first rocket at the Rocket Station: Nose Cone, Rocket Body segments, Rocket Engine, and Fins.",
        "Right-click the completed assembly to create a Launch Pad",
        "Right-click the pad to enter",
        "Pre-launch cargo checklist: filled Space Suit (oxygen topped off at Distributor), food (Farmer's Delight meals with oxygen present), building blocks, torches, weapons (planet mobs), and a Waystone (for instant return)",
        "Tier 1 rockets reach the Moon only.",
        "Tip: Bring a Sophisticated Backpack upgraded to Netherite tier for Moon trips — it holds far more Desh ore per trip than your inventory. The backpack stays with you on death (GraveStone)."
      ],
      "icon": "stellaris:rocket_t1",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "dependencies": [
