    },
    {
      "id": "200020B0",
      "title": "Moon Landing",
      "subtitle": "First Step on Another World",
      "description": [
        "Moon environment: low gravity (jump higher, fall slower), no atmosphere (suit oxygen depletes constantly), no hostile mobs — completely safe for first-time exploration.",
        "Primary resource: Desh ore, the rare Moon metal required for Tier 2 rocket components",
        "First priority upon landing: place Solar Panel to Oxygen Distributor to Water Separator — refill your suit oxygen immediately",
        "Second priority: place a Waystone anywhere on the surface — teleport back to Earth anytime (config set to free)",
        "Third: place a Launch Pad for the return trip",
        "Mine Desh aggressively — you need significant quantities for Tier 2.",
        "If dimension detection fails, use /ftbquests complete <quest_id> (find ID in quest book tooltip)."
      ],
      "icon": "stellaris:moon_stone",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4,
