      "id": "200020B3",
      "title": "Oxygen Management",
      "subtitle": "Blue Bar, 10 Minutes, Distributor Range",
      "description": [
        "Suit oxygen meter (blue, lower-left) depletes continuously on atmosphere-less planets.",
        "Standing near an active Oxygen Distributor refills it",
        "Full suit equals roughly 10 minutes of gameplay",
        "Check the bar before leaving Distributor range",
        "On planets with natural atmosphere (Overworld only), oxygen does not deplete."
      ],
