    {
      "id": "200020BE",
      "title": "Tier 2 Rocket",
      "subtitle": "Mercury and Venus",
      "description": [
        "Crafted with Desh ingots from the Moon.",
        "Reaches two new planets",
        "Mercury: closest to the sun, extreme heat hazard (constant fire damage without protection), low gravity",
        "Resource: Ostranium ore — required for Tier 3 rocket components",
        "Venus: acid rain atmosphere, dense high gravity (slow movement, heavy jumps)",
        "Resource: Tharsite ore — required for Tier 4 rocket components",
        "Strategy for both: land, quickly place Solar Panel to Distributor to Waystone, mine the unique ore, leave",
        "These are raid destinations, not colonies.",
        "Tip: Bring a Waystone to both Mercury AND Venus on your first trip to each. Place it immediately upon landing. Future trips become instant teleports — you only launch to each planet once."
      ],
      "icon": "stellaris:rocket_t2",
      "x": 3,
      "y": 0,
