    {
      "id": "200020C2",
      "title": "Planetary Resources",
      "subtitle": "The Resource-to-Tier Pipeline",
      "description": [
        "Resource progression map: Desh (Moon and Mars, richest on Mars) enables Tier 2 rockets.",
        "Ostranium (Mercury) enables Tier 3",
        "Tharsite (Venus) enables Tier 4",
        "Glacio Crystals (Glacio) are the endgame component",
        "Every planet ore can run through your Mekanism 5x processing line on Earth for maximum yield",
        "Logistics: mine ore on planet, Waystone back to Earth with inventory full, dump into AE2, 5x process, autocraft next-tier rocket components.",
        "Tip: Ship ALL planet ores to Earth for processing — Mekanism 5x works on Stellaris ores (Desh, Ostranium, Tharsite). A single Digital Miner on Earth with 5x processing outperforms manual mining on any planet."
      ],
      "icon": "stellaris:ostranium_ingot",
      "x": 3,
      "y": 1,
      "shape": "hexagon",
      "dependencies": [
