    {
      "id": "200020C7",
      "title": "Mars Base",
      "subtitle": "First Permanent Off-World Colony",
      "description": [
        "Tier 3 rocket (crafted with Ostranium from Mercury).",
        "Destination: Mars — red desert landscape, low gravity, periodic dust storms, hostile dust worms",
        "Mars is the first planet worth a permanent base",
        "Build order: (1) Solar Panel farm — Mars has excellent sunlight",
        "(2) Full Mekanism power setup — bring charged Energy Cubes or run a Fission Reactor",
        "(3) AE2 Quantum Network Bridge to Earth",
        "(4) Chunk Loader",
        "(5) Digital Miner configured for Desh and Ostranium veins",
        "Mars becomes your second industrial hub, producing rare metals autonomously.",
        "If dimension detection fails, use /ftbquests complete <quest_id> (find ID in quest book tooltip).",
        "Mars is worth a permanent base because Desh appears in richer deposits here than on the Moon. Connect a Mekanism Digital Miner to the Mars AE2 Quantum Bridge — Desh and Ostranium auto-mine and auto-ship to Earth."
      ],
      "icon": "stellaris:mars_stone",
