    {
      "id": "200020CB",
      "title": "Interplanetary Logistics",
      "subtitle": "Connect All Worlds",
      "description": [
        "Unify your interplanetary infrastructure.",
        "Waystones (free teleport via config) for personal travel: Earth to Moon to Mars to Glacio — instant, zero cost",
        "AE2 Quantum Network Bridge for storage: stand on Mars, open your ME Terminal, see every item stored on Earth",
        "Create Trains for planet-side bulk transport: move ores from Mars landing pad to Mars ME Interface to Quantum Bridge to Earth 5x line",
        "Goal: autocraft a Tier 4 rocket from your Mars terminal using materials mined on three different planets and processed on Earth.",
        "The Quantum Network Bridge is the AE2 equivalent of Stellaris Waystones — it connects your ME networks across dimensions. Build one on Earth and one on Mars. Your Earth terminal will show Mars items as if they were in the same room."
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:ender_pearl",
