      "title": "Alien Mobs",
      "subtitle": "Dust Worms and Ice Golems",
      "description": [
        "Hostile mobs vary by planet.",
        "Mars: dust worms burrow through sand and ambush",
        "Glacio: ice golems with heavy melee attacks and knockback",
        "Bring your best weapons (Simply Swords unique effects, Apotheosis mythic gear)",
        "Better Combat animations make low-gravity combat feel different — longer jumps, slower falling, wider attack arcs."
