    {
      "id": "200020D4",
      "title": "Space Suit Upgrades",
      "subtitle": "Higher Tiers, More Protection",
      "description": [
        "Higher-tier space suits exist (check EMI (hover item, press R for recipe, U for uses)).",
        "Upgraded suits hold more oxygen (longer excursions), have better durability, and may include built-in environmental protection — heat resistance for Mercury, acid resistance for Venus, cold resistance for Glacio",
        "Upgrade your suit alongside your rocket tiers."
      ],
