    {
      "id": "200020D9",
      "title": "Glacio",
      "subtitle": "Ice Planet — Endgame Destination",
      "description": [
        "Tier 4 rocket (crafted with Tharsite from Venus).",
        "Destination: Glacio — frozen ice planet, extreme cold hazard (accelerated oxygen drain, continuous cold damage without protection), hostile ice golems (heavy damage, knockback, high HP)",
        "Resource: Glacio Crystals — the rarest Stellaris material, used for endgame components",
        "Bring your best gear: MekaSuit (environmental immunity plus flight), Apotheosis Mythic weapons, Simply Swords with Lifesteal or Ice runes",
        "This is your final space frontier — the hardest environment in the pack.",
        "If dimension detection fails, use /ftbquests complete <quest_id> (find ID in quest book tooltip).",
        "Glacio Crystals are to Stellaris what Polonium is to Mekanism — the rarest endgame resource. Process Glacio ores through Mekanism 5x on Earth via Quantum Entangloporter for maximum crystal yield."
      ],
