      "title": "Interplanetary Empire",
      "subtitle": "You Are a Spacefaring Demigod",
      "description": [
        "Achieve full interplanetary automation.",
        "Functional, self-sustaining bases on Earth, Moon, Mars, and Glacio",
        "AE2 network spans all four dimensions via Quantum Bridges",
        "Chunk Loaders keep every base running continuously",
        "Resource flow is automatic: planetary miners extract ores, Mekanism 5x line processes them, AE2 stores and autocrafts",
        "No resource is scarce",
        "No planet is out of reach",
        "No journey takes longer than a Waystone click",
        "Space is conquered",
        "You are a demigod."
