      "id": "200020E0",
      "title": "Stellaris-Mekanism Integration",
      "subtitle": "Instant Ore Transit via Entangloporter",
      "description": [
        "The ultimate Stellaris-Mekanism integration: Quantum Entangloporter on your Glacio mining rig, paired to one on Earth at your 5x processing line.",
        "Glacio ore enters the Entangloporter — instantly appears on Earth — enters the Dissolution Chamber — begins 5x processing",
        "Zero transit time",
        "No Waystone inventory runs",
        "No Quantum Bridge delay",
        "This is interplanetary logistics at its peak.",
        "The Quantum Entangloporter is the ultimate Stellaris-Mekanism bridge — Glacio ore enters the Entangloporter at your ice planet mining rig and instantly appears on Earth at your 5x processing line. Zero transit time. Zero logistics overhead. This is the final form of interplanetary automation."
      ],
